<title>INDIA: Indian Oct steel output rises to 1.17 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Oct steel output rises to 1.17 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian steel output rose to 1.17 million tonnes in October 1996 from 1.16 million in the same month in 1995, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>    STEEL OUTPUT    Oct	Oct	Apr-Oct	Apr-Oct</p>
<p>			 1996     1995	  1996	   1995</p>
<p>			1,170    1,158	 8,049	  7,789</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. They cover India's main plants.</p>
</text>
